===Etymology===
The place name is from {{der|en|ang|Badimyncgtun||estate of (a man called) Baduhelm}}, from the personal name {{m|ang|*Bad}} (possibly also found in Frankish {{m|en|Badon}}) + {{m|ang|helm}} + {{m|ang|-ing|}} + {{m|ang|-tun}}.<ref>Mills, D. (2011). A Dictionary of British Place-Names. United Kingdom: OUP Oxford, p. 29</ref>

